---
import TrustPage from "../components/trust/TrustPage.astro";
import { routeIndexable } from "../lib/indexability";
---

<TrustPage
  title="About"
  description="About Golden Visa Research, which publishes news and research on investment migration."
  noindex={!routeIndexable("/about")}
>
  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p>
    Golden Visa Research publishes news and research on investment migration. The subject is residence by investment and citizenship by investment, kept as separate topics.
  </p>
  <h2>What the publication does</h2>
  <p>
    A page states a program rule, a status, a fee, or an investment amount only when that fact is in a published file with its source. The country profile, the program record, and the status tracker read the same program file.
  </p>
  <h2>What the publication does not do</h2>
  <p>
    The site does not sell residence or citizenship. It does not rank programs, score countries, or recommend a route.
  </p>
  <h2>What is not recorded</h2>
  <p>
    No legal entity, postal address, or named editor is recorded for this publication. No institutional affiliation is recorded.
  </p>
</TrustPage>
